OL,3,AFlash flood on Nepal-Tibet border kills
OL,4,Amore than 150, with hundreds of
OL,5,Atourists missing
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 150 people have been killed
OL,8,Fin Nepal, and hundreds of tourists are
OL,9,Fmissing, after a massive flash flood
OL,10,Fand mudslide
OL,12,FThe missing tourists include more than
OL,13,F100 from India, 54 from the US, and 33
OL,14,Ffrom the UK, as well as more than 100
OL,15,Ffrom Nepal itself, according to Nepal's
OL,16,Ftourist board. The area is popular with
OL,17,Fpilgrims and trekkers
OL,19,FIn Tibet, Chinese state media report
OL,20,Fthree dead and 265 missing. CCTV from
OL,21,FTibet shows a wall of water and mud
OL,22,Fhitting buildings at a border crossing
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
