OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFlash flood on Nepal-Tibet border kills
OL,4,Amore than 150, with hundreds of
OL,5,Atourists missing
OL,6,
OL,7,FDozens of Nepalese police officers and
OL,8,Farmy personnel are also missing, as
OL,9,Fwell as power workers. My family was
OL,10,Fswept away in front of me, one woman
OL,11,Ftells us - she and her son survived by
OL,12,Fclimbing to a rooftop
OL,14,FAuthorities initially thought an
OL,15,Fearthquake may have preceded the
OL,16,Fflooding - but the US Geological Survey
OL,17,Fnow says the "seismic energy was
OL,18,Finstead generated by a landslide"
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
